      <title>5万人如何涌入西班牙在非洲的飞地</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/world/europe/spain-ceuta-migrants-morocco.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[周四，数万名摩洛哥人闯入与摩洛哥毗邻的西班牙领土休达。到周五晚上，他们中的大多数人都带着饥饿和失望离开了。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/world/europe/spain-ceuta-migrants-morocco.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 04:01:14 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>前奥运选手大卫·赫恩因破坏倒影池而被撤销指控</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/david-hearn-reflecting-pool-vandalism-charges.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在联邦检察官承认特朗普政府关于破坏公物的指控是错误的之后，一名前奥运会选手将不会面临审判。]]></description>
