    <item>
      <title>在谈论更换政党时，费特曼发誓“永远不会”</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/amid-talk-of-a-party-switch-fetterman-vows-never.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[改变一个人的隶属关系在参议院很少见，但它可能会产生重大后果。宾夕法尼亚州的约翰·费特曼表示，他将继续担任民主党人。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/amid-talk-of-a-party-switch-fetterman-vows-never.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 01:41:44 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普对法官谴责国税局的裁决提出上诉诉讼作为自我交易的练习</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/trump-appeal-irs-lawsuit-ruling.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[这是总统正在加倍努力争取一项给他带来巨大利益的协议的各个方面的最新迹象，尽管这些协议危及了他对司法部长人选的确认。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/trump-appeal-irs-lawsuit-ruling.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 23:47:53 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普政府计划通过放松管制来扭转领先地位</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/head-start-deregulation.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[白宫试图阻止为贫困儿童提供学前教育资金，但未能成功。相反，它将寻求取消健康、识字和刷牙方面的标准。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/head-start-deregulation.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 20:31:08 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>为什么米奇·麦康奈尔不放弃参议院席位</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/why-mitch-mcconnell-isnt-giving-up-his-senate-seat.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[民主党人要求肯塔基州共和党人辞职。其他长期缺阵的人则没有面临这样的呼吁，但时代正在发生变化。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/why-mitch-mcconnell-isnt-giving-up-his-senate-seat.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 20:23:41 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>是什么导致摩洛哥移民涌入休达？</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/world/europe/migrants-surge-morocco-ceuta-spain.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[人们的猜测集中在摩洛哥宽松的治安、有吸引力的西班牙移民政策以及人口贩运者的错误信息上。专家表示，事实上，现在下结论还为时过早。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/world/europe/migrants-surge-morocco-ceuta-spain.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 19:43:04 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>年轻人涌入休达寻找工作</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/world/europe/young-men-poured-into-ceuta-seeking-work.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[几名移民表示，他们的动机是社交媒体消息声称西班牙边境开放，但这些消息的来源尚不清楚。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/world/europe/young-men-poured-into-ceuta-seeking-work.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 19:18:46 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
